{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48894","headline":"和友人题僧院蔷薇花三首 一 · 崔橹","name":"和友人题僧院蔷薇花三首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"何人移得在蝉家，瑟瑟枝条簇簇霞。\n争那寂寥埋草暗，不胜惆怅舞风斜。\n无缘影对金尊酒，可惜香和石鼎茶。\n看取老僧齐物意，一般抛掷等凡花。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"崔橹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_48894.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48894","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}